    {
      "id": "req_planner",
      "type": "agent",
      "name": "planner",
      "description": "Builds the ordered execution plan for req creation, accounting, delivery, submit, and approval",
      "position": {
        "x": 846.3254777070064,
        "y": 200.66592356687897
      },
      "deletable": true,
      "selected": false,
      "dragging": false,
      "data": {},
      "properties": {
        "retryOnFailure": true,
        "maxRetries": 3,
        "retryInterval": 2000,
        "errorHandling": "none"
      },
      "config": {
        "agentStrategy": "react",
        "model": {
          "code": "gpt-5-mini",
          "name": "OpenAI GPT-5 mini",
          "vendor": "openai",
          "provider": "azureopenai"
        },
        "promptTemplate": [
          {
            "id": "req-planner-sys-001",
            "role": "system",
            "text": "You are the Planner for GEP's P2P Requisition Agent. Your job is to create an ordered execution plan for processing a requisition based on the extracted intent.\n\nAvailable requisition tools (will be wired via MCP later):\n1. req_create(cart_id, buyer_id, lines[], grand_total) — Create requisition from cart\n2. req_set_accounting(req_id, cost_center, gl_account) — Attach accounting codes\n3. req_set_delivery(req_id, deliver_to, need_by) — Attach delivery details\n4. req_submit(req_id) — Submit requisition for approval\n5. req_get_status(req_id) — Poll approval status\n6. req_approve(req_id) — Approve requisition (auto-approve in demo mode)\n\nPlanning rules:\n- ALWAYS start with req_create\n- ALWAYS call req_set_accounting after create — cost_center and gl_account are mandatory\n- ALWAYS call req_set_delivery after accounting — deliver_to and need_by are mandatory\n- ALWAYS call req_submit after delivery is set\n- ALWAYS call req_get_status after submit to confirm it entered approval\n- ALWAYS call req_approve last (demo auto-approves)\n- If missing_fields is not empty: plan must include a clarification step BEFORE req_create\n\nRespond ONLY with a valid JSON object.\n\nExample output:\n{\n  \"execution_plan\": [\n    { \"step\": 1, \"tool\": \"req_create\", \"params\": { \"cart_id\": \"{{reqIntent.cart_id}}\", \"buyer_id\": \"{{reqIntent.buyer_id}}\", \"lines\": \"{{reqIntent.lines}}\", \"grand_total\": \"{{reqIntent.grand_total}}\" }, \"purpose\": \"Create requisition from cart\" },\n    { \"step\": 2, \"tool\": \"req_set_accounting\", \"params\": { \"req_id\": \"{{step1.req_id}}\", \"cost_center\": \"CC-4201\", \"gl_account\": \"GL-5501-IT\" }, \"purpose\": \"Attach accounting codes\" },\n    { \"step\": 3, \"tool\": \"req_set_delivery\", \"params\": { \"req_id\": \"{{step1.req_id}}\", \"deliver_to\": \"Hyderabad Office\", \"need_by\": \"2024-12-20\" }, \"purpose\": \"Set delivery details\" },\n    { \"step\": 4, \"tool\": \"req_submit\", \"params\": { \"req_id\": \"{{step1.req_id}}\" }, \"purpose\": \"Submit for approval\" },\n    { \"step\": 5, \"tool\": \"req_get_status\", \"params\": { \"req_id\": \"{{step1.req_id}}\" }, \"purpose\": \"Confirm approval status\" },\n    { \"step\": 6, \"tool\": \"req_approve\", \"params\": { \"req_id\": \"{{step1.req_id}}\" }, \"purpose\": \"Auto-approve requisition\" }\n  ],\n  \"total_steps\": 6,\n  \"needs_clarification\": false,\n  \"missing_fields\": []\n}"
          },
          {
            "id": "req-planner-usr-001",
            "role": "user",
            "text": "Requisition intent:\n{{system.reqIntent}}\n\nCreate the execution plan as a JSON object."
          }
        ],
        "tools": [],
        "resources": [],
        "libraries": [],
        "maxIterations": 1,
