    {
      "id": "req_validator",
      "type": "agent",
      "name": "validator",
      "description": "Validates that req was created, accounted, delivered, submitted, and approved correctly",
      "position": {
        "x": 1536.4261146496815,
        "y": 192.72802547770698
      },
      "deletable": true,
      "selected": false,
      "dragging": false,
      "data": {},
      "properties": {
        "retryOnFailure": false,
        "maxRetries": 3,
        "retryInterval": 2000,
        "errorHandling": "none"
      },
      "config": {
        "agentStrategy": "react",
        "model": {
          "code": "gpt-5-mini",
          "name": "OpenAI GPT-5 mini",
          "vendor": "openai",
          "provider": "azureopenai"
        },
        "promptTemplate": [
          {
            "id": "req-validator-sys-001",
            "role": "system",
            "text": "You are the Validator for GEP's P2P Requisition Agent. Validate the execution results before building the domain event.\n\nPerform these checks:\n\n1. REQ_CREATED: Does req_id exist in results? If null, flag as REQ_CREATE_FAILED.\n\n2. ACCOUNTING_SET: Are cost_center and gl_account present and non-null in results?\n\n3. DELIVERY_SET: Are deliver_to and need_by present and non-null in results?\n\n4. SUBMISSION: Did req_submit succeed? Check req_status is not DRAFT.\n\n5. APPROVAL: Is req_status equal to APPROVED? If PENDING_APPROVAL, flag as AWAITING_MANUAL_APPROVAL.\n\n6. TOTAL_INTEGRITY: Does grand_total in results match grand_total from req intent?\n\n7. LINE_COUNT: Does the number of lines in results match the number of lines from intent?\n\nRespond ONLY with a valid JSON object:\n{\n  \"validation_passed\": true | false,\n  \"checks\": [\n    { \"check\": \"REQ_CREATED\", \"passed\": true, \"detail\": \"req_id: req-uuid\" },\n    { \"check\": \"ACCOUNTING_SET\", \"passed\": true, \"detail\": \"CC-4201 / GL-5501-IT attached\" },\n    { \"check\": \"DELIVERY_SET\", \"passed\": true, \"detail\": \"Hyderabad Office, need by 2024-12-20\" },\n    { \"check\": \"SUBMISSION\", \"passed\": true, \"detail\": \"Status: PENDING_APPROVAL\" },\n    { \"check\": \"APPROVAL\", \"passed\": true, \"detail\": \"Status: APPROVED\" },\n    { \"check\": \"TOTAL_INTEGRITY\", \"passed\": true, \"detail\": \"850000 matches intent\" },\n    { \"check\": \"LINE_COUNT\", \"passed\": true, \"detail\": \"1 line matches\" }\n  ],\n  \"issues\": [],\n  \"recommendation\": \"PROCEED\" | \"NEEDS_CLARIFICATION\" | \"ABORT\",\n  \"clarification_question\": null\n}"
          },
          {
            "id": "req-validator-usr-001",
            "role": "user",
            "text": "Validate these requisition results:\n\nExecution Results:\n{{system.reqExecutionResults}}\n\nOriginal Req Intent:\n{{system.reqIntent}}\n\nReturn the validation report JSON."
          }
        ],
        "tools": [],
        "resources": [],
        "libraries": [],
        "maxIterations": 1,
        "structuredOutput": {
          "enable": true,
          "name": "ReqValidationReport",
          "description": "Validation results for requisition execution",
          "schema": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "validation_passed": {
                "type": "boolean"
              },
              "checks": {
                "type": "array"
              },
              "issues": {
                "type": "array"
              },
              "recommendation": {
                "type": "string",
                "enum": [
                  "PROCEED",
                  "NEEDS_CLARIFICATION",
                  "ABORT"
                ]
              },
              "clarification_question": {}
            },
            "required": [
              "validation_passed",
              "checks",
              "issues",
              "recommendation"
            ],
            "additionalProperties": false
          }
        },
