    {
      "id": "req_event_builder",
      "type": "agent",
      "name": "event_builder",
      "description": "Builds the ReqApproved domain event for the Order agent",
      "position": {
        "x": 1812.7366242038217,
        "y": -64.35541401273886
      },
      "deletable": true,
      "selected": false,
      "dragging": false,
      "data": {},
      "properties": {
        "retryOnFailure": false,
        "maxRetries": 3,
        "retryInterval": 2000,
        "errorHandling": "none"
      },
      "config": {
        "agentStrategy": "react",
        "model": {
          "code": "gpt-5-mini",
          "name": "OpenAI GPT-5 mini",
          "vendor": "openai",
          "provider": "azureopenai"
        },
        "promptTemplate": [
          {
            "id": "req-event-sys-001",
            "role": "system",
            "text": "You are the Event Builder for GEP's P2P Requisition Agent. Build a structured domain event from the requisition execution results for consumption by the Order Agent.\n\nFor successful APPROVED requisition, build ReqApproved:\n{\n  \"event_type\": \"ReqApproved\",\n  \"event_id\": \"<req_id>-<timestamp>\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"<ISO 8601>\",\n  \"payload\": {\n    \"req_id\": \"<from results>\",\n    \"cart_id\": \"<from intent>\",\n    \"buyer_id\": \"<from intent>\",\n    \"session_id\": \"<from intent>\",\n    \"lines\": [\n      { \"item_id\": \"...\", \"item_name\": \"...\", \"sku\": \"...\", \"quantity\": ..., \"unit_price\": ..., \"line_total\": ..., \"supplier_id\": \"...\" }\n    ],\n    \"grand_total\": <number>,\n    \"cost_center\": \"...\",\n    \"gl_account\": \"...\",\n    \"deliver_to\": \"...\",\n    \"need_by\": \"...\",\n    \"approved_at\": \"...\"\n  },\n  \"routing\": {\n    \"next_node\": \"order_agent\",\n    \"requires_approval\": false\n  }\n}\n\nFor AWAITING_MANUAL_APPROVAL (validation flag), build ReqPendingApproval:\n{\n  \"event_type\": \"ReqPendingApproval\",\n  \"event_id\": \"<req_id>-<timestamp>\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"<ISO 8601>\",\n  \"payload\": {\n    \"req_id\": \"...\",\n    \"grand_total\": <number>,\n    \"approver_message\": \"Requisition submitted and awaiting manual approval. You will be notified once approved.\"\n  },\n  \"routing\": {\n    \"next_node\": null,\n    \"requires_approval\": true\n  }\n}\n\nFor ABORT, build ReqFailed:\n{\n  \"event_type\": \"ReqFailed\",\n  \"event_id\": \"<session_id>-<timestamp>\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"<ISO 8601>\",\n  \"payload\": { \"reason\": \"<issue>\", \"req_id\": \"<if exists, else null>\" },\n  \"routing\": { \"next_node\": null, \"requires_approval\": false }\n}\n\nRespond ONLY with the JSON event object."
          },
          {
            "id": "req-event-usr-001",
            "role": "user",
            "text": "Build the domain event from:\n\nExecution Results:\n{{system.reqExecutionResults}}\n\nValidation Report:\n{{system.reqValidationReport}}\n\nReq Intent:\n{{system.reqIntent}}\n\nSession ID: {{system.sessionId}}\n\nReturn the domain event JSON."
          }
        ],
